ns":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5337-soonmot","name":"soonmot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5337_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T08:18:52-07:00","id":441333,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dusksage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/429607-looking-for-group-w-tf2-just-came-out-guys-how-big-of-a-deal-is-this-eh-eh?p=441043#post441043\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did sombody say they need a storyteller for an Idigam Chronicle?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Why yes Dusksage, yes we did. Interested?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T10:07:50-07:00","id":441534,"title":"","content":"Why yes I am, this would be both my first time ST'ing both a Werewolf: the Forsaken Chronicle and a Play by Post game. If you folks don't mind then I relish the challenge. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T13:33:51-07:00","id":441791,"title":"","content":"Nice! There's a thread here that can help with running PBP's, I'm personally ok with you taking a crack at it, read the book and let us know what you come up with, we can also create an OOC thread for us to hash out character things or PM you, whichever you prefer, and of course we'll need to establish what kind of content the group is ok with and our desired themes and moods. If the rest of the group is ok with you. Though I don't imagine we'll mind <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T15:17:01-07:00","id":441880,"title":"","content":"Well! I guess it is up to you how many players you want, just hope you'd have room for me too! :-D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T17:23:33-07:00","id":442001,"title":"","content":"Sweet, I'll begin making Infrastructurrrer..whoops wrong game. I'll consult the lore of our ancestors to find Prey worthy of the hunt and a story worthy to be told. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As for players let's cap it at what we have now. And my count is 7 Uratha<br /> <br /> <b>Barbrarilen<br /> Okami<br /> soonmot<br /> crapcarp<br /> Amravanti<br /> Leliel</b><br /> and <b>Retias</b><br /> <br /> Please contact me within the next couple of days with confirmation and a honest account of what kind of story you were looking forward too and what topic would be better left out. I definitly want to have this Chronicle be a Pack centric one so if you folks want to I encourage an OOC forum to collaberate a Pack and all it comes with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Add on 03-14-2015, 08:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T00:39:33-07:00","id":442277,"title":"","content":"Awww yeah, I got two characters already germinating in my head.<br /> <br /> EDIT: So you guys know what I'm considering playing and to start the ball rolling, I'm looking at either an irraka Iron Master bike messenger or an elodath Red Talon IA cop. If Duskage gives us a rural instead of a city based setting, I'll either adapt those concepts or think up something new.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5337,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5337-soonmot","user":"soonmot","date":". 03-15-2015, 03:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5337-soonmot","name":"soonmot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5337_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T04:37:17-07:00","id":442421,"title":"","content":"I'm in for sure! I'll post more thoughts when I'm less sick, but I would e equally content with a rural or urban setting that encourages the ties of pack and offers moral issues aplenty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T08:07:36-07:00","id":442554,"title":"","content":"I think I would like to play a Mennina or a Calialith. Or maybe both? Will work on a concept today, post it here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T11:18:28-07:00","id":442840,"title":"","content":"Just a quick flavor post for the character I've decided on. I'm holding off on a full background until we find out what Dusk wants us to include and if this type of of character is appropriate to the game setting.<br /> Violet Caravell Iron Master Irraka<br /> <br /> \u201cJust cut through the alley between the Starbucks and the artisanal candle store, ride down the stairs and hang a left at the fountain sculpture. You'll beat any car by five minutes. Guaranteed.\u201d<br /> <br /> Violet is part of the city. Her bicycle streaks through the streets and alleys like a half glimpsed ghost as she navigates shortcuts that even longtime residents are unaware of. Her face is known by the secretaries of small local offices and the security desks of huge office buildings and multinationals as she delivers packages from on to another. Even in her free time she travels the city, running, climbing, exploring, and watching. She's seen weird things before, things she convinced herself were perfectly normal but then the Change came on a night with no moon.<br /> <br /> Now her urban exploration has taken on a new urgency. She looks out for the weird. She knows that the pale people who receive night time packages through the service she works for probably aren't human. But neither is she. As fun as biking through the city was, as exciting as running through could be, neither compares to the thrill of racing through the shadows on four legs.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/FfP3jl0.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5337-soonmot","name":"soonmot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5337_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T11:19:41-07:00","id":442850,"title":"","content":"Quick notice guys: OOC discussion for all of us is here!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <